<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ARCO Chemical cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ARCO Chemical cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it cut ARCO Chemical Co to intermediate-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept ARCO as long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- a Merrill source later said the firm cut ARCO on price since the stock has gained about 17 percent in the last two months.</p>
</text>
